  "display_title": "Strange Tales from the Moonlit House",
  "description": "Following a tragic accident at age 7, high schooler Yu Dan has been able to see the supernatural with his divine eye. When he finds himself haunted by an ancient being called a misfortune anomaly, Dan is led to the Moonlit House. There, he meets fox spirit Master Baek, who says the only way to avoid misfortune is to transfer it to someone else. Dan is adamant to find another path, but can he banish the calamity in time before it pulls him further into this peculiar world of dangers and spirits?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
